<title>UK: MOTORCYCLE RACING-KOCINSKI SIGNS FOR HONDA.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLE RACING-KOCINSKI SIGNS FOR HONDA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American John Kocinski has signed a one-year contract to race with Honda in the 1997 World Superbike Championship.</p>
<p>Kocinski, 28, who finished third last season riding a Ducati, described the move to Honda as &quot;easily one of the highlights&quot; of his career.</p>
<p>&quot;I know that Honda has a lot to offer and I hope I can reward their faith in me. This is a great opportunity,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
